  "holds": {
    "kosh:gbd:9": "The literal source form is English calamity, while the Persian says ظاهراً معنی موج می دهد. This is not a cleared Pahlavi headword/gloss association; recover the source page.",
    "kosh:gbd:11": "Carry forward the existing compound hold: bare ahlāyīh and ahrāyīh varzišnīh share the phrase gloss بکاربستن پرهیزگاری; do not distribute it to both forms.",
    "kosh:gbd:15": "Carry forward the existing compound hold: bare ahrav and ahlav xᵛadāyīh share پادشاهی به راستکرداری; the isolated-word/phrase scope remains unresolved.",
    "kosh:gbd:16": "Carry forward the existing compound hold: bare ahrav and ahlav bēšišn share آزاردادن مرد راستکردار، صفت کافران; do not train the phrase gloss as the bare-word meaning.",
    "kosh:gbd:17": "Carry forward مادنگی in عقب مادنگی در خرد. Suspected literal Persian defect retained unchanged pending the printed source.",
    "kosh:gbd:55": "The published target contains بی یتیمارگی. This suspicious word/form needs source-page verification; the other glosses do not license silently repairing it.",
    "kosh:gbd:160": "اتفاق افتادن (؟) is explicitly uncertain and coexists with بسته شدن نطفه. Preserve both and the question mark; hold from an ordinary certain-target inventory until scope is resolved.",
    "kosh:gbd:194": "Carry forward the published نحراب کردن alongside افتادن. Known source-text anomaly; no correction inferred.",
    "kosh:gbd:203": "کشتن، اژون includes an unexplained اژون token. Its role as archaic gloss, source-form annotation or damaged text is unresolved; do not manufacture a second sense or silently drop it.",
    "kosh:gbd:224": "The final published gloss انوسیدن is suspicious beside source anbūsīdan and the same-source انبوسیدن at GBD196. Preserve the whole original inventory; resolve against print.",
    "kosh:gbd:235": "The lunar definition says از اول تا پنجم مهرماه. MacKenzie gives andarmāh = new moon; the apparent restriction to Mehr versus a possible هرماه spelling issue needs the Bahar page. No silent correction.",
    "kosh:gbd:241": "فرجام ناویدن is a suspicious/incompletely interpretable target for avēnāg frajāmih. Do not guess a repaired wording or claim a settled meaning.",
    "kosh:gbd:246": "Published روئیت requires the same conservative orthographic review already applied to this spelling in the lead review. Meaning is understandable; this is an orthographic source hold, not proof of semantic reversal.",
    "kosh:gbd:288": "Published تراویدتی in گیاهان تراویدتی و قابل افشردن is a suspected letter-level defect; retain the bačagān/bajagān form bundle without inventing a correction.",
    "kosh:gbd:303": "Published استشام کردن is a suspected incomplete spelling in the smell gloss. Original source page needed; بوئیدن is not removed or rewritten.",
    "kosh:gbd:315": "Published deity name اسپندارند in the epithet note is suspicious. Name/annotation fidelity matters even though دارای اندیشه کامل is readable; verify the printed name.",
    "kosh:gbd:319": "Published نتهی الیه is a suspected missing-letter defect. MacKenzie bēdom = furthermost supports the general meaning but does not authorize a silent Persian repair.",
    "kosh:gbd:361": "Carry forward the placeholder-only target (؟); no usable primary meaning is supplied.",
    "kosh:gbd:393": "The source form itself is (?) fragūdan. Preserve the uncertainty and hold from an ordinary certain-reading inventory.",
    "kosh:gbd:412": "pad gōhtīg / اصیل has a suspicious transcription compared with separately attested gōhrīg. This comparison does not prove the intended reading; require the original page before changing or admitting the suspect form.",
    "kosh:gbd:446": "به سرعت، با قدرت، (؟)؛ شاید has explicit unresolved scope/uncertainty. Preserve the entire original; do not emit selected confident-looking senses as a complete inventory.",
    "kosh:gbd:467": "zahā is glossed عمل، ژرفا. Scoped MacKenzie zahā means depth, so عمل is a suspected material letter/meaning defect, not established polysemy. Verify print; do not silently substitute عمق.",
    "kosh:gbd:476": "zahyā repeats عمل، ژرفا. The same action/depth discrepancy as GBD467 needs source adjudication; retain this separate source form rather than merging it.",
    "kosh:gbd:483": "Bare hān and compound ān ēvag share دیگری، آن یک. Their per-form sense attachment is unresolved; retain the original bundle but hold the ordinary inventory rather than let the isolated form inherit all compound meanings. This is a scope hold, not a declaration that the published contextual reading is wrong.",
    "kosh:gbd:486": "Bare ān and compound hān rāy share بدان علّت. The causal phrase requires its rāy construction; hold until variant/compound scope is resolved rather than assign the causal meaning to the isolated demonstrative.",
    "kosh:gbd:506": "Published از میان رفتنن contains duplicated final ن. The separate contextual sense of sazīdan is retained; this hold is for the literal defect, not a forced replacement by another dictionary sense.",
    "kosh:gbd:530": "The forms are bare farrah and xᵛarrah - ōmandīh, but the target is فرهمندی. Suffix/alternative-form attachment is unresolved; hold as with the earlier bare-form/compound anomalies, without Cartesian expansion.",
    "kosh:gbd:533": "suft = سفته (صفت) = تراشیده (؟) explicitly questions the adjective interpretation. Keep it distinct from nominal شانه at GBD534; hold the uncertain record only.",
    "kosh:gbd:538": "The grammatical annotation is published as (فعال لازم). Its wording is suspicious beside an infinitive gloss; verify source grammar annotation rather than silently changing it to فعل لازم.",
    "kosh:gbd:582": "Carry forward نجام دادن in the multi-sense kirdan inventory. Keep کردن and ساختن alongside the unresolved literal defect; do not silently repair or discard one sense.",
    "kosh:gbd:635": "marnjēnīdan has میراندن، از میان برد. The second gloss appears incomplete for this inventory and the headword differs from independently attested margēnīdan. Neither spelling nor tense is silently corrected; inspect the source page.",
    "kosh:gbd:662": "متخر کردن is unexplained/suspicious inside the long griftan inventory. Preserve all other meanings and do not choose a replacement or collapse this to one winning sense.",
    "kosh:gbd:752": "Carry forward مادن in the ēstādan inventory. Keep the complete published range and auxiliary/context distinctions; resolve the apparent missing-letter defect.",
    "kosh:gbd:769": "Published کماشتن alongside گماردن is the earlier source-spelling concern. Require source evidence before changing it to another spelling; no implicit correction."
  },
